Dashboard Plus adds twelve widgets to the OPNsense dashboard, next to the
built-in ones: System Information+, Traffic Graph+, System Metrics+, Thermal
Sensors+, Interface Statistics+, Gateways+, Interfaces+, Firewall Logs+, DNS
Health+, Services+, QuickAssist+ and CARP+.
They extend the standard widgets with hardware, firmware and CPU security
details, configurable time windows, per-interface colors, field selection
and drag-to-reorder, without modifying the OPNsense core.

Privileges remain scoped to the data each widget uses. Services+ control,
DNS Health+ status and CARP+ status are separate Dashboard privileges; native OPNsense data
continues to require its existing OPNsense privilege.
